.\" Manual page for docmost-cli-workspace(1)
.\" Source: SPECIFICATION.md section 4.7, src/docmost_cli/cli/workspace.py
.TH DOCMOST\-CLI\-WORKSPACE 1 "2026\-03\-22" "docmost\-cli 0.7.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
docmost\-cli\-workspace \- Docmost workspace information
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B docmost\-cli workspace info
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.RB [ \-\-fields
.IR a,b,c ]
.br
.B docmost\-cli workspace members
.RB [ \-\-limit
.IR N ]
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands for viewing Docmost workspace details and membership.
A workspace is the top\-level entity that contains all spaces, pages,
and users.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.SS info
Show workspace details.
.PP
Displays key\-value pairs: name, id, description, memberCount, createdAt.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output the complete workspace object as JSON.
The key\-value view shows a curated subset; this shows everything the server
returned.
.TP
.BI \-\-fields " a,b,c"
Comma\-separated list of fields to output, for both renderers.
.SS members
List workspace members.
.TP
.BI \-\-limit " N"
Maximum total number of members across all pages.
When omitted, every page is retrieved.
.TP
.BI \-\-page\-size " N"
Results per request, 1\-100. Default: 100.
.TP
.BI \-\-cursor " cursor"
Fetch a single page of results starting at this cursor.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-follow
Fetch a single page of results instead of following pagination.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as a JSON array.
Each element is the complete object the server returned, not just the table
columns.
.TP
.BI \-\-fields " a,b,c"
Comma\-separated list of fields to output.
Applies to both
.B \-\-json
and the table, replacing the default columns.
Names are matched against the fields the server returned; an unknown name is a
usage error listing what is available.
.TP
.B \-\-envelope
With
.BR \-\-json ,
include pagination metadata.
.PP
Default table columns: id, email, name, role.
These affect the table only; \-\-json emits every field the server returns.
.SH EXAMPLES
Show workspace details:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli workspace info
.EE
.RE
.PP
List all members:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli workspace members
.EE
.RE
.PP
List members as JSON:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli workspace members \-\-json | jq \(aq.[].email\(aq
.EE
.RE
